{"manifest":{"schema":1,"id":"com.idj.ext.avbigplat","name":"AV大平台","version":"1.0.0","author":{"name":"py 蜘蛛改写"},"description":"AV大平台（porndav.com，蜘蛛 Zaka9SexAmns 1:1 改写）。分类照蜘蛛：首页 /video/type/ 动态抽取（现行 5 类：中文/無碼/歐美/國產/AI短劇），不足 3 个回退蜘蛛硬编码 15 类，末尾附下载日榜。列表/详情/搜索 HTML 直解，封面 image.porndav.com。正片需站方登入購買（購買單隻付费墙，不绕），插件只给站方对匿名访客免费下发的約 90 秒預告 HLS（porndav.com/trailer/<id>，AES-128、密钥公开，分片 *.sh06.co），详情与线路名均如实标注預告。搜索已按站方真实表单字段修复（type=films&query=，蜘蛛原 q= 参数站方已不认）。free/短影片/每日上新三类为站方客户端加载页、无服务端卡片，蜘蛛与插件同样取空。由内置 jar 蜘蛛 Zaka9SexAmns 改写。","type":"video","adult":true,"language":["zh"],"minAppVersion":"1.5","entry":"main.js","permissions":{"http":["porndav.com","image.porndav.com","9sex.tv","www.9sex.tv","*.sh06.co"],"media":["porndav.com","image.porndav.com","9sex.tv","www.9sex.tv","*.sh06.co"],"cloudflare":false,"storage":false,"login":false},"capabilities":["home","category","search","detail","play"],"settings":[],"update":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hoyittvggfh45/moytv/plugins/avbigplat/avbigplat.idjplugin"},"integrity":"sha256-dR1MUHCd9F6poAcl6uCPWIqj/z2rUIaLepOmnyVYPjY="},"files":{"main.js":"// avbigplat - idj1 plugin, rewritten from the built-in jar spider\n// com.github.catvod.spider.Zaka9SexAmns (registry key avbigplat,\n// name \"🔞AV大平台┃蝴蝶\", spider getName \"AV大平台\", ext empty).\n// Plain-HTML station (Laravel + Livewire shells on some pages).\n// Domains are ZakaSec-obfuscated in the jar; decoded (see the\n// 2026-11-18 diagnosis): DOMAINS = [https://porndav.com,\n// https://www.9sex.tv, https://9sex.tv], HOST = https://porndav.com,\n// LANG = /tw. The two 9sex.tv hosts sit behind a Cloudflare managed\n// challenge (403 on every probe, and the host app does not solve\n// challenges for plugins), so the plugin uses porndav.com only --\n// it is the spider's HOST and serves the real pages directly\n// (verified 200 with fresh content). Covers live on\n// image.porndav.com; trailer segments/keys live on *.sh06.co.\n//\n// Protocol, 1:1 with the spider unless a repair is marked:\n// - home: GET HOST/tw, categories extracted from the page's\n//   /video/type/<slug> links (name <= 14 chars, dedupe, cap 60);\n//   fewer than 3 -> the spider's hardcoded CATS table (15 entries);\n//   the spider then always appends {rank, \"📊 下载日榜\"} (the plugin\n//   appends it only when \"rank\" is not already present, so the id\n//   stays unique). Home items = parseList(homepage).\n// - category: pathOf(id) exactly as the spider (CATS lookup, else\n//   /tw/video/type/<id>), page>1 appends ?page= / &page=.\n// - parseList: strip header/nav/footer, RE_DETAIL anchor regex,\n//   title = the anchor title attribute (site suffix stripped),\n//   else cleaned inner text, else \"影片 <id>\" -- the spider's two\n//   title sources with the order swapped, because the current\n//   card body's cleaned text leads with badge/date noise; cover\n//   = last usable <img> in the anchor\n//   block, else last usable img up to 900 chars before it, else\n//   first usable img up to 900 chars after it; images containing\n//   logo/icon/avatar or an ad host are skipped; dedupe by id,\n//   cap 60; zero hits -> RE_DETAIL_ANY fallback (id-only cards).\n//   REPAIR: the spider caps the anchor body at 4000 chars, but the\n//   site's current cards carry a long responsive srcset and run\n//   ~5400 chars, so the spider regex now matches nothing and every\n//   list would fall back to coverless id-only cards. The plugin\n//   raises the cap to 12000; everything else is unchanged.\n// - detail: GET /tw/video/detail/<id>; title h1 -> og:title,\n//   cover og:image -> first img, description og:description /\n//   description, plus the spider's 演员/标签/时长/日期 lines built\n//   from the /actors/ and /tag/ links, the duration and date\n//   regexes. (The spider's debug \"破解诊断\" suffix is dropped.)\n// - Streams: the spider's digStream hunts the detail page for a\n//   playable URL (m3u8 regex -> JSON file/src/url keys -> <source>\n//   src -> mp4 -> base64/hex blobs -> media iframes). On the live\n//   site the static page contains no full-film URL at all: the\n//   player is Plyr + hls.js and its only source is the inline call\n//   loadFilm('https://porndav.com/trailer/<id>'), which returns an\n//   AES-128 HLS playlist directly (verified: 23 segments, ~90 s,\n//   key public at skey.sh06.co, first segment decrypts to real\n//   MPEG-TS). The full film is sold per-title behind login\n//   (\"購買單隻\" on the detail page) -- no anonymous full-film\n//   stream exists in the page or its JS bundles (2026-11-19 full\n//   audit), and the plugin does not bypass paywalls. So play()\n//   returns exactly what the site freely serves an anonymous\n//   visitor: the trailer stream, labelled 預告 everywhere, with\n//   the paywall stated in the detail description. digStream is\n//   still run first (with the 2026-11-18 fix-B exclusions\n//   speed_test/download_test, plus the spider's own\n//   preview/sample/trailer/banner and ad-host exclusions): if a\n//   real direct stream ever appears in the page it wins, exactly\n//   like the spider's L1 line.\n// - search REPAIR: the spider's GET /tw/search?q=<kw> is dead --\n//   the site ignores q and returns an empty Livewire shell\n//   (verified 0 results). The form's real fields are type=films\n//   and query=<kw> (verified: 12 real results for a code query).\n//   The plugin uses GET /tw/search?type=films&query=<kw> first,\n//   then falls back to the spider's original GET q= and POST\n//   /tw/search chain unchanged. The result page has no pagination\n//   links, so search reports hasMore=false.\n// - Categories free/shorts/daily are client-loaded Livewire\n//   shells with zero server-rendered cards (verified again for\n//   free: 200, 0 detail anchors); the spider gets the same empty\n//   list there, and so does the plugin -- honestly empty, not an\n//   error.\n// - The spider retries pages across DOMAINS and via relays; the\n//   plugin has no relay and the alias domains are CF-challenged,\n//   so a failed porndav.com fetch throws E_NETWORK / E_CF_REQUIRED\n//   instead of the spider's silent empty page.\n\nconst HOST = \"https://porndav.com\";\nconst LANG = \"/tw\";\nconst UA = \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/128.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\";\nconst TIMEOUT = 55000;\nconst ATTEMPTS = 2;\n\nconst CATS = [\n    [\"all\", \"🎬 最新上架\", \"/tw/video/all\"],\n    [\"exclusive\", \"🔥 大平台獨家\", \"/tw/video/exclusive\"],\n    [\"jav\", \"🇯🇵 中文\", \"/tw/video/type/jav\"],\n    [\"not-pixelated\", \"🚫 無碼\", \"/tw/video/type/not-pixelated\"],\n    [\"europe-america\", \"🌍 歐美\", \"/tw/video/type/europe-america\"],\n    [\"china\", \"🇨🇳 國產\", \"/tw/video/type/china\"],\n    [\"free\", \"🎁 限時免費\", \"/tw/free\"],\n    [\"cumshot\", \"💦 中出內射\", \"/tw/video/cumshot\"],\n    [\"big-boobs\", \"🍈 巨乳\", \"/tw/video/big-boobs\"],\n    [\"wife\", \"💍 人妻\", \"/tw/video/wife\"],\n    [\"ntr\", \"💔 NTR\", \"/tw/video/ntr\"],\n    [\"monomer-works\", \"🎞 單體作品\", \"/tw/video/monomer-works\"],\n    [\"shorts\", \"📱 短影片\", \"/tw/shorts\"],\n    [\"rank\", \"📊 排行榜\", \"/tw/rank\"],\n    [\"daily\", \"📅 每日上新\", \"/tw/daily\"],\n];\nconst CAT_PATH = {};\nfor (const c of CATS) CAT_PATH[c[0]] = c[2];\n\nconst AD_HOSTS = [\"magsrv\", \"exoclick\", \"juicyads\", \"trafficjunky\", \"doubleclick\", \"googletagmanager\", \"googlesyndication\", \"chaturbate\", \"stripchat\", \"bongacams\", \"popads\", \"propeller\", \"adsterra\", \"clickadu\", \"hilltopads\", \"onclickads\", \"adnium\", \"trafficstars\", \"pemsrv\", \"tsyndicate\", \"a-ads\", \"vidoomy\", \"zplayer\", \"mgid\"];\nconst MEDIA_HINTS = [\"porndav\", \"9sex\"];\n\nconst RE_DETAIL = /<a[^>]+href=\"([^\"]*?\\/video\\/detail\\/(\\d+)[^\"]*)\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]{0,12000}?)<\\/a>/g;\nconst RE_DETAIL_ANY = /\\/video\\/detail\\/(\\d+)/g;\nconst RE_CAT_LINK = /<a[^>]+href=\"([^\"]*?\\/video\\/type\\/([a-z0-9\\-]+))\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]{0,80}?)<\\/a>/g;\nconst RE_IMG = /(?:data-src|data-original|data-lazy-src|data-echo|src)=\"(https?:\\/\\/[^\"]+?\\.(?:jpe?g|png|webp|gif))\"/gi;\nconst RE_TITLE_ATTR = /title=\"([^\"]{2,120})\"/;\nconst RE_H1 = /<h1[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/h1>/;\nconst RE_OG = /<meta[^>]+(?:property|name)=\"(og:title|og:image|og:description|description|keywords)\"[^>]+content=\"([^\"]*)\"/g;\nconst RE_DUR = /(?:duration|時長|时长|片長)[^0-9]{0,20}(\\d{1,3}\\s*[:：]\\s*\\d{2}(?:\\s*[:：]\\s*\\d{2})?)/;\nconst RE_DATE = /(20\\d{2}[-/.]\\d{1,2}[-/.]\\d{1,2})/;\nconst RE_ACTOR = /<a[^>]+href=\"([^\"]*?\\/actors\\/(\\d+))\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]{0,60}?)<\\/a>/g;\nconst RE_TAG = /<a[^>]+href=\"([^\"]*?\\/tag\\/([^\"\\/]+))\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]{0,40}?)<\\/a>/g;\nconst RE_M3U8 = /https?:\\/\\/[^\\s\"'<>\\\\\\)]+?\\.m3u8[^\\s\"'<>\\\\\\)]*/gi;\nconst RE_MP4 = /https?:\\/\\/[^\\s\"'<>\\\\\\)]+?\\.(?:mp4|m4v)[^\\s\"'<>\\\\\\)]*/gi;\nconst RE_KEY_JSON = /\"(?:file|src|source|url|video|videoUrl|play_url|playUrl|m3u8|hls|hlsUrl|stream|streamUrl|path)\"\\s*:\\s*\"([^\"]{12,600})\"/g;\nconst RE_SOURCE_SRC = /<(?:source|video)[^>]+src=\"([^\"]+)\"/g;\nconst RE_IFRAME = /<iframe[^>]+src=\"([^\"]+)\"/g;\nconst RE_LOADFILM = /loadFilm\\(\\s*'([^']+)'\\s*\\)/;\nconst RE_B64 = /\"([A-Za-z0-9+/]{40,}={0,2})\"/g;\nconst RE_HEX = /\"([0-9a-fA-F]{48,})\"/g;\n\nfunction str(v) { return v == null ? \"\" : String(v); }\nfunction intVal(v, fb) { const n = parseInt(v, 10); return isFinite(n) ? n : fb; }\nfunction mkErr(code, msg) { const e = new Error(msg); e.code = code; return e; }\n// Host form gate for play URLs (idj_contract._isPlayableUrl):\n// https, no userinfo, port absent or 443, host not an IP literal.\nfunction playableForm(u) {\n    const m = /^https:\\/\\/([^/?#]+)/i.exec(str(u));\n    if (!m) return false;\n    const auth = m[1];\n    if (auth.indexOf(\"@\") >= 0) return false;\n    let hostPart = auth;\n    const colon = auth.lastIndexOf(\":\");\n    if (colon >= 0) {\n        if (auth.slice(colon + 1) !== \"443\") return false;\n        hostPart = auth.slice(0, colon);\n    }\n    if (/^\\d{1,3}(\\.\\d{1,3}){3}$/.test(hostPart)) return false;\n    if (hostPart.indexOf(\":\") >= 0) return false; // IPv6 literal\n    return /^[a-z0-9\\-\\.]+$/i.test(hostPart);\n}\n\nfunction unesc(s) {\n    if (s == null) return \"\";\n    return String(s)\n        .replace(/&amp;/g, \"&\").replace(/&lt;/g, \"<\").replace(/&gt;/g, \">\")\n        .replace(/&quot;/g, \"\\\"\").replace(/&#39;/g, \"'\").replace(/&#x27;/g, \"'\")\n        .replace(/&nbsp;/g, \" \");\n}\nfunction clean(s) { return unesc(str(s).replace(/<[^>]+>/g, \" \")).replace(/\\s+/g, \" \").trim(); }\nfunction enc(s) { return encodeURIComponent(str(s)).replace(/%20/g, \"+\"); }\n\nfunction hit(text, words) {\n    const t = str(text).toLowerCase();\n    for (const w of words) if (t.indexOf(w) >= 0) return true;\n    return false;\n}\nfunction absUrl(base, rel) {\n    try { return host.url.resolve(base, rel); } catch (e) { return str(rel); }\n}\n\nfunction pageHeaders(referer) {\n    return {\n        \"User-Agent\": UA,\n        \"Accept\": \"text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8\",\n        \"Accept-Language\": \"zh-TW,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8\",\n        \"Referer\": referer || (HOST + LANG),\n    };\n}\n\nfunction okPage(body) {\n    if (!body || body.length < 400) return false;\n    if (body.length > 20000) return true;\n    const low = body.toLowerCase();\n    return low.indexOf(\"just a moment\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"challenge-platform\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"challenges.cloudflare.com\") < 0;\n}\nfunction isChallenge(body, status, headers) {\n    if (headers && str(headers[\"cf-mitigated\"]).indexOf(\"challenge\") >= 0) return true;\n    // Spider okPage(): a page over 20000 chars is a real page, full\n    // stop -- live porndav pages embed one cdn-cgi/challenge-platform\n    // jsd script tag without being challenge pages. The textual\n    // markers only decide small pages.\n    if (body && body.length > 20000) return false;\n    const low = str(body).toLowerCase();\n    return low.indexOf(\"just a moment\") >= 0 || low.indexOf(\"challenge-platform\") >= 0 || low.indexOf(\"cf_chl_opt\") >= 0;\n}\n\n// Spider page(): shield fetch, then relay; the plugin has only the\n// direct fetch, retried once, and fails loudly instead of \"\".\nasync function fetchPage(url, referer) {\n    let lastErr = null;\n    for (let i = 0; i < ATTEMPTS; i++) {\n        try {\n            const r = await host.http.get(url, {headers: pageHeaders(referer), timeout: TIMEOUT});\n            if (isChallenge(r.body, r.status, r.headers)) {\n                throw host.error(\"E_CF_REQUIRED\", \"站方回了 Cloudflare 托管挑战，插件无法解盾：\" + url);\n            }\n            if (r.status !== 200) throw mkErr(\"E_NETWORK\", \"页面 HTTP \" + r.status + \"：\" + url);\n            if (okPage(r.body)) return r.body;\n            lastErr = mkErr(\"E_PARSE\", \"页面内容不合格（过短或挑战页）：\" + url);\n        } catch (e) {\n            lastErr = e;\n            if (e && e.code === \"E_CF_REQUIRED\") throw e;\n        }\n    }\n    throw lastErr || mkErr(\"E_NETWORK\", \"取页失败：\" + url);\n}\n\nfunction imgUsable(u) {\n    const low = str(u).toLowerCase();\n    return low.indexOf(\"logo\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"icon\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"avatar\") < 0 && !hit(low, AD_HOSTS);\n}\nfunction lastImg(text) {\n    let out = \"\";\n    RE_IMG.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = RE_IMG.exec(text)) !== null) if (imgUsable(m[1])) out = m[1];\n    return out;\n}\nfunction firstImg(text) {\n    RE_IMG.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = RE_IMG.exec(text)) !== null) if (imgUsable(m[1])) return m[1];\n    return \"\";\n}\n\n// Spider parseList(), with the anchor-body cap repair noted above.\nfunction parseList(html) {\n    if (!html) return [];\n    const s = html\n        .replace(/<header[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/header>/gi, \" \")\n        .replace(/<nav[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/nav>/gi, \" \")\n        .replace(/<footer[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/footer>/gi, \" \");\n    const items = [];\n    const seen = {};\n    RE_DETAIL.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    let prevEnd = 0;\n    while ((m = RE_DETAIL.exec(s)) !== null) {\n        const id = m[2];\n        if (!seen[id]) {\n            seen[id] = true;\n            // Title sources are the spider's two, order swapped:\n            // the anchor title attribute (site suffix stripped)\n            // first, because the current card body's cleaned text\n            // leads with badge/date noise (\"無 碼 中 文 2026/11/26\n            // ...\"); the cleaned body text stays as fallback.\n            let title = \"\";\n            const t = RE_TITLE_ATTR.exec(m[0]);\n            if (t) {\n                title = clean(t[1]);\n                const cut = title.indexOf(\" - AV大平台\");\n                if (cut > 0) title = title.slice(0, cut).trim();\n            }\n            if (title.length < 2) title = clean(m[3]);\n            if (title.length < 2) title = \"影片 \" + id;\n            if (title.length > 60) title = title.slice(0, 60);\n            let pic = lastImg(m[0]);\n            if (!pic) {\n                const from = Math.max(prevEnd, m.index - 900);\n                pic = lastImg(s.slice(from, m.index));\n            }\n            if (!pic) pic = firstImg(s.slice(m.index + m[0].length, m.index + m[0].length + 900));\n            const item = {id: id, title: title};\n            if (pic) item.cover = pic;\n            items.push(item);\n            if (items.length >= 60) break;\n        }\n        prevEnd = m.index + m[0].length;\n    }\n    if (items.length === 0) {\n        RE_DETAIL_ANY.lastIndex = 0;\n        let a;\n        while ((a = RE_DETAIL_ANY.exec(s)) !== null) {\n            const id = a[1];\n            if (seen[id]) continue;\n            seen[id] = true;\n            items.push({id: id, title: \"影片 \" + id});\n            if (items.length >= 60) break;\n        }\n    }\n    return items;\n}\n\nfunction pathOf(id) {\n    const t = str(id).trim();\n    if (!t) return LANG;\n    if (t.indexOf(\"http\") === 0) {\n        const i = t.indexOf(LANG);\n        return i >= 0 ? t.slice(i) : \"\";\n    }\n    if (CAT_PATH[t]) return CAT_PATH[t];\n    return t.indexOf(\"/\") === 0 ? t : \"/tw/video/type/\" + t;\n}\n\nfunction detailUrlOf(id) {\n    const t = str(id).trim();\n    if (t.indexOf(\"http\") === 0) return t;\n    const m = /detail\\/(\\d+)/.exec(\"/\" + t);\n    return HOST + LANG + \"/video/detail/\" + (m ? m[1] : t);\n}\nfunction idOf(url) {\n    const m = /detail\\/(\\d+)/.exec(str(url));\n    return m ? m[1] : \"\";\n}\n\nfunction og(html, key) {\n    RE_OG.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = RE_OG.exec(html)) !== null) {\n        if (m[1].toLowerCase() === key.toLowerCase()) return unesc(str(m[2]).trim());\n    }\n    return \"\";\n}\nfunction pick(html, re) {\n    const m = re.exec(html);\n    return m ? clean(m[1]) : \"\";\n}\n\n// --- spider digStream() ---\nfunction firstUrl(re, text, base) {\n    re.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = re.exec(text)) !== null) {\n        const u = absUrl(base, str(m[0]).replace(/\\\\\\//g, \"/\").replace(/&amp;/g, \"&\").trim());\n        const low = u.toLowerCase();\n        if (u.length >= 12 && low.indexOf(\"preview\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"sample\") < 0 &&\n            low.indexOf(\"trailer\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"banner\") < 0 &&\n            low.indexOf(\"speed_test\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"download_test\") < 0 &&\n            !hit(low, AD_HOSTS)) {\n            return u;\n        }\n    }\n    return \"\";\n}\nfunction isPlayable(u) {\n    const low = str(u).toLowerCase();\n    if (low.length < 12 || hit(low, AD_HOSTS)) return false;\n    if (low.indexOf(\"speed_test\") >= 0 || low.indexOf(\"download_test\") >= 0) return false;\n    return low.indexOf(\".m3u8\") > 0 || low.indexOf(\".mp4\") > 0 || low.indexOf(\".m4v\") > 0 ||\n        low.indexOf(\"m3u8?\") > 0 || low.indexOf(\"/hls/\") > 0 || low.indexOf(\"/vod/\") > 0;\n}\nfunction normalize(raw, base) {\n    const t = str(raw).replace(/\\\\\\//g, \"/\").replace(/&amp;/g, \"&\").trim();\n    if (t.length < 12) return \"\";\n    if (isPlayable(t)) return t;\n    const low = t.toLowerCase();\n    if (low.indexOf(\"player\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"embed\") < 0 && low.indexOf(\"/v/\") < 0) return \"\";\n    return absUrl(base, t);\n}\nfunction digStream(html, pageUrl, depth) {\n    if (!html) return \"\";\n    const s = str(html).replace(/\\\\\\//g, \"/\").replace(/&amp;/g, \"&\");\n    let u = firstUrl(RE_M3U8, s, pageUrl);\n    if (u) return u;\n    RE_KEY_JSON.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = RE_KEY_JSON.exec(s)) !== null) {\n        const n = normalize(m[1], pageUrl);\n        if (n && isPlayable(n)) return n;\n    }\n    u = firstUrl(RE_SOURCE_SRC, s, pageUrl);\n    if (u && isPlayable(u)) return u;\n    u = firstUrl(RE_MP4, s, pageUrl);\n    if (u) return u;\n    RE_B64.lastIndex = 0;\n    let n = 0;\n    while ((m = RE_B64.exec(s)) !== null && n < 20) {\n        n++;\n        let dec = \"\";\n        try { dec = host.codec.base64Decode(m[1], {to: \"utf8\"}); } catch (e) { dec = \"\"; }\n        if (dec && dec.indexOf(\"http\") >= 0) {\n            u = firstUrl(RE_M3U8, dec, pageUrl) || firstUrl(RE_MP4, dec, pageUrl);\n            if (!u && isPlayable(dec)) u = dec.trim();\n            if (u) return u;\n        }\n    }\n    RE_HEX.lastIndex = 0;\n    n = 0;\n    while ((m = RE_HEX.exec(s)) !== null && n < 10) {\n        n++;\n        let dec = \"\";\n        try { dec = host.codec.convert(m[1], \"hex\", \"utf8\"); } catch (e) { dec = \"\"; }\n        if (dec && dec.indexOf(\"http\") >= 0) {\n            u = firstUrl(RE_M3U8, dec, pageUrl) || firstUrl(RE_MP4, dec, pageUrl);\n            if (u) return u;\n        }\n    }\n    if (!depth || depth < 1) {\n        // The spider fetches media iframes and digs again inline;\n        // here the candidates are collected for the async wrapper\n        // digDeep() below.\n        RE_IFRAME.lastIndex = 0;\n        n = 0;\n        while ((m = RE_IFRAME.exec(s)) !== null && n < 6) {\n            n++;\n            const frameUrl = absUrl(pageUrl, m[1]);\n            const low = frameUrl.toLowerCase();\n            if (!hit(low, AD_HOSTS) && hit(low, MEDIA_HINTS) && frameUrl !== pageUrl) {\n                pendingFrames.push(frameUrl);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return \"\";\n}\n\nlet pendingFrames = [];\nasync function digDeep(html, pageUrl) {\n    pendingFrames = [];\n    let u = digStream(html, pageUrl, 0);\n    if (u) return u;\n    const frames = pendingFrames.slice(0, 3);\n    for (const f of frames) {\n        try {\n            const r = await host.http.get(f, {headers: pageHeaders(pageUrl), timeout: 15000});\n            if (r.status === 200 && r.body) {\n                u = digStream(r.body, f, 1);\n                if (u) return u;\n            }\n        } catch (e) { /* iframe dig is best-effort, like the spider's catch-all */ }\n    }\n    return \"\";\n}\n\nfunction loadFilmOf(html) {\n    const m = RE_LOADFILM.exec(str(html));\n    return m ? m[1] : \"\";\n}\n\nasync function detailData(id) {\n    const url = detailUrlOf(id);\n    const html = await fetchPage(url, HOST + LANG);\n    let title = pick(html, RE_H1);\n    if (!title) title = og(html, \"og:title\");\n    if (!title) title = \"影片 \" + str(id);\n    let cover = og(html, \"og:image\");\n    if (!cover) cover = firstImg(html);\n    let desc = og(html, \"og:description\");\n    if (!desc) desc = og(html, \"description\");\n    const dm = RE_DUR.exec(html);\n    const duration = dm ? dm[1].replace(/：/g, \":\").replace(/\\s+/g, \"\") : \"\";\n    const dtm = RE_DATE.exec(html);\n    const date = dtm ? dtm[1] : \"\";\n    const actors = [];\n    RE_ACTOR.lastIndex = 0;\n    let m;\n    while ((m = RE_ACTOR.exec(html)) !== null && actors.length < 12) {\n        const name = clean(m[3]);\n        if (name && name.length <= 20 && actors.indexOf(name) < 0) actors.push(name);\n    }\n    const tags = [];\n    RE_TAG.lastIndex = 0;\n    while ((m = RE_TAG.exec(html)) !== null && tags.length < 12) {\n        const name = clean(m[3]);\n        if (name && name.length <= 16 && tags.indexOf(name) < 0) tags.push(name);\n    }\n    const parts = [];\n    if (desc) parts.push(desc);\n    if (actors.length) parts.push(\"演员: \" + actors.join(\" / \"));\n    if (tags.length) parts.push(\"标签: \" + tags.join(\" / \"));\n    if (duration) parts.push(\"时长: \" + duration);\n    if (date) parts.push(\"日期: \" + date);\n    return {url: url, html: html, title: title, cover: cover, desc: parts.join(\"\\n\"), tags: tags, duration: duration};\n}\n\nexport default {\n    async home() {\n        const html = await fetchPage(HOST + LANG, HOST + \"/\");\n        const cats = [];\n        const seenCat = {};\n        RE_CAT_LINK.lastIndex = 0;\n        let m;\n        while ((m = RE_CAT_LINK.exec(html)) !== null && cats.length < 60) {\n            const slug = m[2];\n            const name = clean(m[3]);\n            if (slug && name && name.length <= 14 && !seenCat[slug]) {\n                seenCat[slug] = true;\n                cats.push({id: slug, name: name});\n            }\n        }\n        if (cats.length < 3) {\n            cats.length = 0;\n            for (const c of CATS) { cats.push({id: c[0], name: c[1]}); seenCat[c[0]] = true; }\n        }\n        if (!seenCat[\"rank\"]) cats.push({id: \"rank\", name: \"📊 下载日榜\"});\n        const items = parseList(html);\n        return {categories: cats, items: items, hasMore: items.length > 0};\n    },\n\n    async category(args) {\n        const page = Math.max(1, intVal(args && args.page, 1));\n        const path = pathOf(args && args.id);\n        if (!path) throw host.error(\"E_PARSE\", \"分类路径为空\");\n        let url = HOST + path;\n        if (page > 1) url += (path.indexOf(\"?\") >= 0 ? \"&\" : \"?\") + \"page=\" + page;\n        const html = await fetchPage(url, HOST + LANG);\n        const items = parseList(html);\n        return {items: items, hasMore: items.length > 0};\n    },\n\n    async search(args) {\n        const kw = str(args && args.keyword).trim();\n        if (!kw) throw host.error(\"E_PARSE\", \"搜索词为空\");\n        const page = Math.max(1, intVal(args && args.page, 1));\n        const q = enc(kw);\n        // Repaired primary (real form fields), then the spider's\n        // original GET and POST fallbacks, unchanged.\n        const tries = [\n            HOST + \"/tw/search?type=films&query=\" + q + (page > 1 ? \"&page=\" + page : \"\"),\n            HOST + \"/tw/search?q=\" + q + (page > 1 ? \"&page=\" + page : \"\"),\n        ];\n        for (const url of tries) {\n            try {\n                const html = await fetchPage(url, HOST + LANG);\n                const items = parseList(html);\n                if (items.length > 0) return {items: items, hasMore: false};\n            } catch (e) {\n                if (e && e.code === \"E_CF_REQUIRED\") throw e;\n            }\n        }\n        try {\n            const r = await host.http.post(HOST + LANG + \"/search\", \"q=\" + q + \"&keyword=\" + q, {\n                headers: Object.assign(pageHeaders(HOST + LANG), {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\n                }),\n                timeout: TIMEOUT,\n            });\n            if (r.status === 200 && okPage(r.body)) {\n                const items = parseList(r.body);\n                if (items.length > 0) return {items: items, hasMore: false};\n            }\n        } catch (e) {\n            if (e && e.code === \"E_CF_REQUIRED\") throw e;\n        }\n        return {items: [], hasMore: false};\n    },\n\n    async detail(args) {\n        const d = await detailData(args && args.id);\n        const direct = await digDeep(d.html, d.url);\n        const trailer = loadFilmOf(d.html);\n        const numId = idOf(d.url) || str(args && args.id);\n        const lines = [];\n        let desc = d.desc;\n        if (direct) {\n            lines.push({name: \"AV大平台·直链\", episodes: [{id: \"url@@\" + direct, name: \"正片\"}]});\n        }\n        if (trailer) {\n            lines.push({name: \"AV大平台·預告\", episodes: [{id: \"lf@@\" + numId + \"@@\" + trailer, name: \"預告（約90秒）\"}]});\n            desc += (desc ? \"\\n\" : \"\") + \"本站正片需登入購買（購買單隻），免費僅提供預告；插件只給站方免費下發的預告流，不繞付費牆。\";\n        }\n        if (!lines.length) {\n            lines.push({name: \"AV大平台\", episodes: [{id: \"paywall@@\" + numId, name: \"正片（需站方購買）\"}]});\n            desc += (desc ? \"\\n\" : \"\") + \"本站正片需登入購買，站方未免費下發可播流。\";\n        }\n        const out = {id: str(args && args.id), title: d.title, desc: desc, tags: d.tags, lines: lines};\n        if (d.cover) out.cover = d.cover;\n        return out;\n    },\n\n    async play(args) {\n        const raw = str((args && (args.id || args.episodeId)) || \"\");\n        let streamUrl = \"\";\n        let referer = HOST + LANG;\n        let name = \"正片\";\n        if (raw.indexOf(\"url@@\") === 0) {\n            streamUrl = raw.slice(5);\n        } else if (raw.indexOf(\"lf@@\") === 0) {\n            const rest = raw.slice(4);\n            const sep = rest.indexOf(\"@@\");\n            const numId = sep >= 0 ? rest.slice(0, sep) : \"\";\n            streamUrl = sep >= 0 ? rest.slice(sep + 2) : \"\";\n            if (numId) referer = HOST + LANG + \"/video/detail/\" + numId;\n            name = \"預告\";\n        } else if (raw.indexOf(\"paywall@@\") === 0) {\n            throw host.error(\"E_PARSE\", \"本站正片需登入購買，站方未免費下發正片流，插件不繞付費牆\");\n        } else if (raw.indexOf(\".m3u8\") > 0 || raw.indexOf(\".mp4\") > 0) {\n            streamUrl = raw;\n        } else {\n            // Bare detail id / detail URL: fetch the page and dig,\n            // exactly the spider's detail@@ path.\n            const d = await detailData(raw.replace(/^detail@@/, \"\"));\n            streamUrl = await digDeep(d.html, d.url);\n            referer = d.url;\n            if (!streamUrl) {\n                const trailer = loadFilmOf(d.html);\n                if (trailer) { streamUrl = trailer; name = \"預告\"; }\n            }\n            if (!streamUrl) throw host.error(\"E_PARSE\", \"详情页未找到站方免費下發的流（正片需購買）\");\n        }\n        if (!playableForm(streamUrl)) {\n            throw host.error(\"E_PARSE\", \"流地址形态不合规：\" + streamUrl);\n        }\n        const isHls = streamUrl.indexOf(\".m3u8\") >= 0 || /\\/trailer\\/\\d+$/.test(streamUrl);\n        return {\n            streams: [{\n                url: streamUrl,\n                format: isHls ? \"hls\" : \"mp4\",\n                name: name,\n                headers: {\"User-Agent\": UA, \"Referer\": referer},\n            }],\n        };\n    },\n};\n"}}